## Related errors {% #errors %}

- [PLUGIN_ATTACK_CAP](/errors/#plugin-attack-cap): the settings do not save because too many attack plugins are on.
- [TOO_MANY_ATTACK_PLUGINS](/errors/#too-many-attack-plugins): an account has more attack plugins on than the cap allows, so its bot does not start.
- [PLUGIN_OPTION_ARMY](/errors/#plugin-option-army): an army setting can't be read.
